      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHEER ROCK LADY (2) has been racing at Gloucester Park where she drew on the back row and was held up last week. Came from this barrier when midfield in the Westbred 4M Classic prior. Should enjoy an economical run from this draw and looks nicely placed. TURBO JAY (5) had been building to a win and it arrived at his latest appearance when he overcame a back row draw and scored by 5 metres, maintaining an unbeaten record at this circuit and distance. Big chance to deliver again. FOLLOW ROCKNROLL (9) is suited returning to this venue having finished runner-up here two back. TA IN ADVANCE (7) last appeared when fourth here three-and-a-half months ago. Draws wide but is worth keeping safe fresh.",
